often use no padding while grid tables without padding look cramped:</paragraph><table><title>simple table, not padded in the source</title><tgroup cols="4"><colspec colwidth="3"></colspec><colspec colwidth="1"></colspec><colspec colwidth="1"></colspec><colspec colwidth="1"></colspec><thead><row><entry><paragraph>A</paragraph></entry><entry><paragraph>B</paragraph></entry><entry><paragraph>C</paragraph></entry><entry><paragraph>D</paragraph></entry></row></thead><tbody><row><entry><paragraph>100</paragraph></entry><entry><paragraph>2</paragraph></entry><entry><paragraph>3</paragraph></entry><entry><paragraph>4</paragraph></entry></row><row><entry><paragraph>EUR</paragraph></entry><entry><paragraph>b</paragraph></entry><entry><paragraph>c</paragraph></entry><entry><paragraph>d</paragraph></entry></row></tbody></tgroup></table><table><title>grid table, padded cells</title><tgroup cols="4"><colspec colwidth="5"></colspec><colspec colwidth="3"></colspec><colspec colwidth="3"></colspec><colspec colwidth="3"></colspec><thead><row><entry><paragraph>A</paragraph></entry><entry><paragraph>B</paragraph></entry><entry><paragraph>C</paragraph></entry><entry><paragraph>D</paragraph></entry></row></thead><tbody><row><entry><paragraph>100</paragraph></entry><entry><paragraph>2</paragraph></entry><entry><paragraph>3</paragraph></entry><entry><paragraph>4</paragraph></entry></row><row><entry><paragraph>EUR</paragraph></entry><entry><paragraph>b</paragraph></entry><entry><paragraph>c</paragraph></entry><entry><paragraph>d</paragraph></entry></row></tbody></tgroup></table><paragraph>For better typographic results, setting the <title_reference>width</title_reference> and/or
